    <briefdescription>
<para>IMA/DVI ADPCM Speech and Audio Codec (Encoder &amp; Decoder). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements a lightweight, zero-heap, integer-only IMA-ADPCM codec. Achieves 4:1 compression ratio (16-bit linear PCM &lt;-&gt; 4-bit ADPCM nibbles). Fully compatible with standard WAV IMA-ADPCM files and tools (ffmpeg, Audacity).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Usage Example</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structSYN__ADPCM__State" kindref="compound">SYN_ADPCM_State</ref><sp/>state;</highlight></codeline>
